Demo Slides Placeholder
======================

This is a placeholder file for demo-slides.pdf.
In the actual implementation, this would be a 6-slide PDF presentation
following the guidelines in 02-guide.md section 5.1.

Slide contents would typically include:
1. Problem Statement & JTBD
2. Solution Overview & Slice Definition
3. Prototype Demo (with mock/real parts highlighted)
4. Validation Results & Metrics
5. Impact Assessment & Scalability
6. Lessons Learned & Next Steps